<title>USA: TABLE - Apache Corp sells debentures.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Apache Corp sells debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Apache Corp was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Apache Corp, explores for, develops, produces natural gas and crude oil.</p>
<p>BORROWER APACHE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 8/15/2047</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 98.656  FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.478 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +88 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((Caryn Trokie, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
